    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have digitized my dog so we can go on walks forever and you can join us too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short and peaceful walking simulator, inspired by real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In This Game You Can: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Pet the dog! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/867096c129db487962eb121a0b95a69c.poster.avif?t=1728506499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/867096c129db487962eb121a0b95a69c.webm?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/867096c129db487962eb121a0b95a69c.mp4?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play fetch &amp; tug of war with our dog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/4cede8f28bba4afa1e0efc8d860a9d8e.poster.avif?t=1728506499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/4cede8f28bba4afa1e0efc8d860a9d8e.webm?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/4cede8f28bba4afa1e0efc8d860a9d8e.mp4?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover photos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/22f400040c33bdbe453e34c96834c1ee.poster.avif?t=1728506499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/22f400040c33bdbe453e34c96834c1ee.webm?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/22f400040c33bdbe453e34c96834c1ee.mp4?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Put things in your backpack </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/f53c69c8fbe80ec3d5e185123ad80223.poster.avif?t=1728506499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/f53c69c8fbe80ec3d5e185123ad80223.webm?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/f53c69c8fbe80ec3d5e185123ad80223.mp4?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/8bd3e8f290ec5ae3ca2a52a4413a66b4.poster.avif?t=1728506499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/8bd3e8f290ec5ae3ca2a52a4413a66b4.webm?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1566550/extras/8bd3e8f290ec5ae3ca2a52a4413a66b4.mp4?t=1728506499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> And also relax and enjoy the sounds of nature </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Now you can also customize your characters, wear hats and play as the dog (after finishing one walk)!</h2>",
